			"notes": "Small update after playing online with friends.\n\n- If a friend is on Echoes, their line doesn't show above their head anymore (their panels already show it, so it was doubled). The song name still shows. If you turned off other players' Echoes, you still get the line above their head\n- Friends' Echoes are way less crowded: just the line they're on now plus the one before it, which fades after a few seconds. Max 8 on screen, and they fade out when they're far away or when you're standing right in one\n- Friends' panels don't land on top of your own lyrics anymore (Classic, Pop, Neon and Wave)\n- They also move sideways to get out of each other's way, and stop jumping around\n\nJust replace the old jar. Your friends need 1.1.2 too for the above-head part."
		},
