			"notes": "Fix for the online stuff (badges, lyrics above heads, shared Echoes).\n\n- Fixed \"Couldn't verify your Minecraft account\" showing up for everyone, even on official accounts. The online part basically never connected before, sorry about that\n- Offline / cracked accounts can use the online features now too\n- If you're on an official account, friends on cracked servers can see your badge and lyrics as well\n- The Online tab shows whether you're on as an official or offline account\n\nYour login still never leaves the game. Official accounts are checked with the key Minecraft already uses to sign chat messages.\n\nJust replace the old jar. Everyone needs to be on 1.1.1 to see each other properly."
